From f2236d595fe086fa109eab44763b10c1e16ce65e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:17:46 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] WIP: course folder generator (TypeScript port, part 1)

Adds exceljs, jszip and @xmldom/xmldom, plus the first modules of the
course-folder generator: Word XML helpers, attainment model and rules,
and readers for course_information.xlsx and course_outline.docx.
Not wired into the UI yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BE2UHP816kUcpU2VSMQzUY
